WEBVTT

00:18.900 --> 00:22.670
Why? What just happened?

00:22.670 --> 00:24.190
What have I...?

00:29.260 --> 00:32.000
Help me, Oji-sama!

02:15.010 --> 02:16.710
Mechanical Output is increasing.

02:16.710 --> 02:18.450
Optimal velocity reached.

02:18.450 --> 02:22.200
High-power gravitational field opened. Connection to dimensional network established.

02:22.200 --> 02:25.790
We will be back inside Earth's zone in 3 hours.

02:26.690 --> 02:29.040
It was a huge failure.

02:29.520 --> 02:36.500
Gather the Seven Jewels, use their power to open the gate to Rikai, and start our counterattack...

02:37.170 --> 02:38.470
was how it was supposed to happen.

02:47.780 --> 02:49.290
Damage assessment?

02:49.290 --> 02:50.270
Sir!

02:50.630 --> 02:54.610
The equivalent of 5000 kilometers of Saturn's ring was destroyed.

02:54.610 --> 02:56.770
Most of Saturn's satellite moons were destroyed,

02:56.770 --> 03:00.000
including Pandora, Prometheus and Iapetus.

03:00.570 --> 03:03.730
We have lost half of our fleet.

03:04.270 --> 03:09.350
But, since Nightmare-dono and the other Core level wizards were able to raise a barrier in time

03:09.350 --> 03:12.750
their losses are fewer compared to the rest of the fleet.

03:13.240 --> 03:16.620
Losses on the Emulator side were also extensive.

03:16.620 --> 03:19.270
Their surviving fleet quickly retreated from the front line after the attack.

03:19.270 --> 03:22.190
I believe they returned to Rikai.

03:22.860 --> 03:26.070
So even the great Bell was taken aback by it.

03:26.070 --> 03:32.770
After taking that kind of damage, even the Emulators will need some time to reorganize their forces.

03:32.770 --> 03:34.310
You cannot enter!

03:34.750 --> 03:38.780
Anzelotte-sama is currently too busy to speak with ordinary wizards.

03:38.780 --> 03:41.770
Shut up! I said let me through!

03:41.770 --> 03:43.570
I'm sorry, but please, I beg you.

03:52.040 --> 03:53.500
You isolated Elis, didn't you!

03:54.010 --> 03:56.040
Anzelotte! Explain yourself!

03:56.040 --> 04:02.010
We did just as you told us, to gather the jewels! And look what happened!

04:02.010 --> 04:05.020
That power that Elis-chan used, just what was that?

04:05.020 --> 04:07.430
Did you know things would turn out like this?!

04:09.790 --> 04:11.930
Answer me, Anzelotte!!

04:11.930 --> 04:13.330
Don't get in my way!

04:13.330 --> 04:14.570
It's all right.

04:15.520 --> 04:19.520
Everything that has happened is not what I had predicted.

04:20.020 --> 04:28.910
No, not just me. Not even Bell Zephyr or any of the other Devils from Rikai could have seen what was coming.

04:29.320 --> 04:31.520
I don't want to hear your excuses!

04:31.520 --> 04:34.540
Say it clearly, what the hell happened?!

04:38.190 --> 04:42.550
Shiho Elis is... the Greater Devil Syaimaar's reincarnation.

04:49.280 --> 04:54.690
I see, it really was something that wasn't written in your book, huh?

04:55.080 --> 04:58.940
The Greater Devil Syaimaar's present day revival.

04:59.590 --> 05:05.650
There was no record of the existence of the Greater Devil Syaimaar written anywhere in the first place.

05:06.090 --> 05:14.000
The adversary of the world, the light of destruction, all that remains are nothing but scraps of information regarding him.

05:14.540 --> 05:21.370
Even when and what world the satan existed we don't know certainly.

05:21.370 --> 05:30.260
Syaimaar... he is despair, he is nothingness. His existence alone invites destruction.

05:31.560 --> 05:35.520
The seven wings, from which a mere flicker brings destruction,

05:35.520 --> 05:41.480
The heavens and earth, humans and devils, everything as one is reduced to ashes.

05:42.630 --> 05:50.610
It's said that Syaimaar passed down the power of wisdom to the humans.

05:51.590 --> 05:54.750
We still don't know the whole picture,

05:55.290 --> 05:57.650
but we know one thing for sure.

05:57.650 --> 06:02.710
That is, if Syaimaar were to return, everything would be destroyed.

06:03.460 --> 06:06.020
The world... and Rikai too...

06:06.020 --> 06:07.830
Everything without discrimination.

06:07.830 --> 06:11.090
The world... and even Rikai...

06:13.020 --> 06:17.000
To him, our feeble "will" doesn't exist.

06:17.000 --> 06:23.000
His very presence itself, means the destruction of the world. The return to absolute nothingness.

06:23.550 --> 06:29.500
I know that what I saw in the Tower of Babel wasn't something you could talk to.

06:29.500 --> 06:32.390
But, Elis is totally different!

06:32.390 --> 06:37.730
Right now, Syaimaar has yet to completely awaken.

06:37.730 --> 06:41.420
He is being held down by Elis-san's will.

06:42.250 --> 06:48.600
But it is impossible for the will of one person to hold Syaimaar back forever.

06:49.150 --> 06:56.120
If something triggers it, she'll lose her will and the true Syaimaar will awaken.

06:58.030 --> 07:00.560
What's the trigger?

07:00.790 --> 07:02.020
I don't know.

07:02.540 --> 07:09.400
Whether Elis-san herself was shaken up, or if it was the effect of Syaimaar's presence, is still unknown.

07:09.830 --> 07:12.910
But, if we leave her like this, Elis-chan will...

07:12.910 --> 07:16.190
Yes, she probably can't hold him for long.

07:20.040 --> 07:21.080
Stop this nonsense!

07:21.710 --> 07:23.740
Isn't there anything we can do to help her?!

07:23.740 --> 07:25.090
Anzelotte!

07:25.810 --> 07:28.050
Can't we take her bracelet off?

07:29.010 --> 07:33.900
Th-That's right, we should just take that bracelet off of her!

07:33.900 --> 07:36.680
As long as we can take Syaimaar's power away from him, then Elis-chan...

07:36.110 --> 07:36.680
No.

07:40.510 --> 07:44.470
Do you think we haven't been trying?

07:45.770 --> 07:47.400
But it was futile.

07:48.040 --> 07:53.700
Even if we tried to take the bracelet off her left hand, Syaimaar's power will repel us.

07:58.010 --> 08:05.630
I've already ordered every wizard in the world to gather any and all information regarding Syaimaar.

08:05.630 --> 08:09.880
There is nothing we can do, as long as we have no counter plan against him.

08:10.310 --> 08:11.580
That's...

08:11.580 --> 08:13.930
Let me talk to Elis.

08:13.930 --> 08:15.000
I can't let you.

08:15.000 --> 08:15.990
Why not?!

08:15.990 --> 08:17.640
We're her friends!

08:18.170 --> 08:19.900
That is precisely the reason.

08:19.900 --> 08:26.600
I predict that Elis's emotions will be greatly influenced by seeing you.

08:26.600 --> 08:31.110
And that itself, might be the trigger for Syaimaar's revival.

08:31.110 --> 08:37.010
Can you, Hiiragi Renji-san, take responsibility for that?

08:39.460 --> 08:44.880
Now please leave, I will call for you once we have developed a plan of action.

08:52.260 --> 08:56.090
This should also be outside of Anzelotte's predictions.

08:56.420 --> 08:58.880
Her plan as the defender of the world...

08:58.880 --> 09:02.460
fell apart, when she accidentally revived the Greater Devil who would destroy the world.

09:02.460 --> 09:04.140
How incredibly ironic.

09:04.510 --> 09:10.520
I wonder if something was rushed, when Anzelotte was collecting her information.

09:10.520 --> 09:18.990
Could be, or, is there someone who purposely gave Anzelotte false information?

09:21.210 --> 09:23.490
I won't let it end like this.

09:23.490 --> 09:27.560
I'm definitely going to find out why this happened.

09:29.860 --> 09:32.540
I won't let Syaimaar have it his way.

09:32.540 --> 09:38.760
The world needs only one Greater Devil to exist, and I, Bell Zephyr, alone am enough.

09:49.430 --> 09:52.770
That Anzelotte, what is she thinking?

09:53.170 --> 09:54.810
What is Syaimaar anyway?!

09:54.810 --> 09:56.990
Elis will destroy the world?

09:56.990 --> 09:59.640
There's no way she'd do such thing!

10:05.560 --> 10:07.040
That hurts, Kureha!

10:07.040 --> 10:08.620
Sorry, Sorry.

10:10.990 --> 10:12.810
Cure... Water...

10:15.980 --> 10:18.330
Don't be too reckless, okay?

10:19.780 --> 10:26.150
When I saw you jumping out by yourself, I really thought you were going to die...

10:26.150 --> 10:29.640
Idiot, there's no way I'd die that easily.

10:33.000 --> 10:34.860
You're right...

10:35.290 --> 10:40.350
Despite what Anzelotte said, I just can't let Elis be on her own.

10:40.350 --> 10:43.110
Isn't she the one suffering the most right now?

10:43.110 --> 10:44.130
Yeah...

10:44.130 --> 10:47.830
Can't we somehow sneak into her room and talk to her?

10:48.250 --> 10:54.220
But, then what if, just if mind you, Elis went berserk again...

10:54.220 --> 10:58.010
If that happens, all we've got to do is save her again, right?

11:02.540 --> 11:08.100
But if we fail, this time, this time for sure, we'd really...

11:11.830 --> 11:13.650
This doesn't taste good.

11:28.780 --> 11:33.760
That is... are you really, seriously saying that, Gaizar?

11:34.260 --> 11:36.420
Is there no other way?

11:39.080 --> 11:43.530
Gaizar, did you predict that things would occur like this?

11:43.530 --> 11:48.010
For what reason did you make us, and them collect the jewels?

11:50.310 --> 11:54.020
I don't understand your intentions.

11:54.020 --> 11:57.260
Just what do you want me to do?

11:59.330 --> 12:00.690
Anzelotte,

12:02.700 --> 12:07.730
think what you must do for the sake of the world.

12:13.170 --> 12:15.330
I understand.

12:15.940 --> 12:19.880
Gaizar, our God. Lord of all.

12:33.460 --> 12:35.560
Nightmare-san, Mayuri-san!

12:55.640 --> 12:57.890
W-What's wrong?

12:57.890 --> 13:00.360
You all, have such scary faces...

13:01.310 --> 13:06.050
Shiho Elis... no, the Greater Devil Syaimaar.

13:08.340 --> 13:10.010
This is for the sake of the world.

13:10.610 --> 13:11.960
Forgive me.

13:16.320 --> 13:19.690
With this, Syaimaar won't be able to resist us.

13:20.230 --> 13:25.950
Is this really the only option we have left?

13:28.240 --> 13:32.450
At least while she's asleep, she can go without suffering.

13:45.370 --> 13:46.930
My light.

14:02.530 --> 14:04.510
Elis...san...?

14:13.470 --> 14:16.370
I did it again...? No...!

14:18.370 --> 14:21.170
It's Syaimaar! Syaimaar is getting away!

14:23.570 --> 14:25.550
Syaimaar's assassination failed!

14:25.550 --> 14:27.970
Declare a state of emergency.

14:27.970 --> 14:31.530
Assign everyone to capturing and assassinating Syaimaar,

14:31.530 --> 14:33.510
as well as anyone who interferes.

14:33.510 --> 14:37.180
No matter what happens, we cannot let that thing survive!

14:40.520 --> 14:42.370
What's the commotion?

14:42.370 --> 14:44.860
Syaimaar is on the run heading toward the Akatsuki Tower!

14:44.860 --> 14:48.600
All the forces, even wizards, have been put on duty, don't let her escape!

14:48.600 --> 14:49.400
What?!

14:49.400 --> 14:50.320
Elis-chan!

14:50.670 --> 14:52.840
Why is this happening?!

14:52.840 --> 14:54.240
I am Syaimaar?!

14:56.500 --> 14:57.700
There she is!

15:09.460 --> 15:10.380
Did we get her?!

15:10.380 --> 15:11.890
Don't let your guard down!

15:11.890 --> 15:13.470
Attack her one more time!

15:22.030 --> 15:23.010
Who is he?

15:23.010 --> 15:24.050
It doesn't matter!

15:24.050 --> 15:25.980
Kill anyone who interferes!

15:29.470 --> 15:30.570
Im-Impossible!

15:31.570 --> 15:33.000
Kirihito-kun...

15:36.620 --> 15:38.290
What is the meaning of this, Anzelotte!

15:38.720 --> 15:40.320
This is for the sake of the world.

15:40.320 --> 15:43.950
For the sake of the world, and you think killing Elis will put an end to it?!

15:43.950 --> 15:45.030
Cut the crap!

15:45.030 --> 15:47.410
Until now, for what reason did we do all of those miss-

15:47.410 --> 15:49.360
I don't have time to argue with you.

15:49.360 --> 15:54.220
In order to destroy Syaimaar, before he fully awakens we have to act now.

15:54.220 --> 15:58.280
Do what you like! I'm going to go and save Elis!

15:58.280 --> 16:01.930
You mustn't, the Longinus troop has already been put on duty!

16:02.330 --> 16:05.000
So what?! If we leave her, Elis will...

16:05.000 --> 16:08.020
I want to save her too!

16:08.020 --> 16:13.910
But Elis right now is Syaimaar... She holds a power no one can overcome...

16:14.600 --> 16:17.280
Even you, Hiiragi, you're injured like this...

16:18.330 --> 16:19.880
I hate it.

16:19.880 --> 16:22.900
Killing the weak for the sake of many.

16:22.900 --> 16:24.830
We've been protecting her all this time.

16:25.260 --> 16:27.040
And we're going to protect her now.

16:28.170 --> 16:29.550
Hiiragi...

16:34.740 --> 16:41.720
Kureha-san, Akari-san. To the request which I am about to make, please answer with 'Okay' or 'Yes'.

16:46.050 --> 16:48.690
Kirihito-kun, wait, I am...

16:49.270 --> 16:51.650
You are the reincarnation of the Greater Devil Syaimaar.

16:52.570 --> 16:55.860
But you are, someone who should not die here.

16:55.860 --> 16:57.200
There they are!

16:57.810 --> 16:58.990
That's as far as you go!

17:07.380 --> 17:09.090
Hiiragi-senpai!

17:09.090 --> 17:10.450
Kirihito?

17:10.450 --> 17:11.740
You, why?

17:11.740 --> 17:12.840
Stay back.

17:13.260 --> 17:18.240
Your just pretending to be a friend, in order to lower our gaurd so you can kill Elis, aren't you?

17:19.270 --> 17:20.790
Don't be ridiculous!

17:20.790 --> 17:22.240
I am here to save Elis!

17:22.240 --> 17:26.940
I can't trust a wizard who has been following Anzelotte's orders all this time.

17:27.570 --> 17:31.570
You couldn't protect her when she needed you most, even though you were her bodyguard.

17:32.260 --> 17:37.030
Or have you just been monitoring her while pretending to be her guardian?

17:37.030 --> 17:38.360
What?

17:38.360 --> 17:43.790
Aren't you planning to be a good senpai and kill her when you get the cha-

17:46.470 --> 17:48.790
Hiiragi-senpai is not that kind of person!

17:54.160 --> 17:54.880
I...

17:54.880 --> 17:57.470
No, its okay.

17:58.010 --> 17:59.360
I'm sorry.

17:59.360 --> 18:03.360
Kirihito, just who the hell are you?

18:03.360 --> 18:06.000
Why did you go to this extent to protect Elis?

18:06.520 --> 18:09.400
Aren't you the same?

18:09.950 --> 18:12.720
I don't approve of Anzelotte's methods.

18:13.290 --> 18:19.000
There has be a much better way to save the world than killing Elis here.

18:19.530 --> 18:21.530
That's what I believe.

18:22.120 --> 18:27.260
Whether you believe it or not, I am only protecting Elis.

18:29.630 --> 18:31.520
Elis, let's go.

18:32.880 --> 18:34.010
What's wrong?

18:34.010 --> 18:43.220
I, if I'm Syaimaar, then if I die here... that way would be better for Hiiragi and everyone's sake.

18:44.960 --> 18:48.870
Have you ever thought that you wanted to destroy the world?

18:48.870 --> 18:50.190
N-No!

18:50.190 --> 18:53.540
In that case, there is no need at all for you to die!

18:53.540 --> 18:54.730
Raise your head and stand tall!

19:05.430 --> 19:07.880
They've passed through the Silver Pathway.

19:07.880 --> 19:11.920
Syaimaar and Hiiragi Renji along with one unknown individual are heading towards the main shaft.

19:11.920 --> 19:14.300
They are heading toward Earth.

19:12.780 --> 19:14.300
That boy is...

19:20.170 --> 19:23.470
Hiiragi! This is the only one that moves right now.

19:23.470 --> 19:25.280
That's only a two seater, isn't it?

19:25.280 --> 19:26.780
We're over limit!

19:26.780 --> 19:28.010
Not a problem at all.

19:28.990 --> 19:31.010
Then, how are we going to do it?

19:31.010 --> 19:32.860
Like this.

19:36.200 --> 19:37.460
What?

19:46.120 --> 19:48.380
Hiiragi-senpai!

19:48.380 --> 19:50.910
Kirihito, you bastard!

19:58.120 --> 20:00.460
Ouch, ouch, ouch...

20:00.820 --> 20:05.970
Like a hawk falling from the sky, pretty pathetic, Hiiragi Renji.

20:05.970 --> 20:07.500
What did you say?!

20:07.500 --> 20:11.020
Then how about you try falling through the atmosphere without any protection yourself?

20:12.520 --> 20:14.350
You!

20:19.840 --> 20:24.450
Good grief, do you want Anzelotte's haika to find us?

20:24.450 --> 20:29.010
Or have you even, given the slightest thought on what to do next?

20:29.790 --> 20:31.870
Umm... that is...

20:31.870 --> 20:32.980
Excuse me...

20:50.500 --> 20:53.030
The thing you wanted to get, is that it?

20:53.030 --> 20:54.130
Yes.

20:54.130 --> 20:58.010
My Daddy Long Legs book and, the letter from my Oji-sama.

20:58.550 --> 21:03.690
These alone are, the things that show me that it's all right for me to live in this world, they're that special to me.

21:04.500 --> 21:07.430
Everything else is gone.

21:09.620 --> 21:12.010
I can no longer come back here.

21:12.520 --> 21:14.730
And no one's coming back.

21:17.790 --> 21:20.460
For me, there's nothing else...

21:22.630 --> 21:29.470
By collecting the jewels, and protecting the world... I should have been able to meet my Oji-sama...

21:30.250 --> 21:33.570
Why? Why does something like this...?!

21:37.130 --> 21:38.040
That's it!

21:38.740 --> 21:40.480
You have you're Oji-sama, right?!

21:40.480 --> 21:43.530
He's the one who saved you and brought you out of the orphanage, right?

21:43.530 --> 21:46.170
I'm sure that he'd be able help you!

21:46.170 --> 21:50.120
But, I don't know anything about him...

21:50.120 --> 21:56.340
He never showed me his face or told me his name when he took me from the orphanage.

21:57.020 --> 21:58.670
How about we go and see?

22:00.290 --> 22:05.510
Even if you never saw him, the teacher at the orhpanage should know about him.

22:05.510 --> 22:07.550
He's right, let's give it a try!

22:07.550 --> 22:08.260
Yes!

22:18.520 --> 22:19.760
What's wrong?

22:19.760 --> 22:23.610
It's a good luck charm written in Daddy Long Legs.

22:23.610 --> 22:29.260
It says that if you look at a crescent moon from your right shoulder, something good will happen.

22:34.540 --> 22:36.000
They're already here.

22:36.000 --> 22:41.240
There are too many of them, my magic is more suited for this than you're sword.

22:41.240 --> 22:43.320
Leave them to me and go on.

22:43.320 --> 22:44.250
What about you...

22:45.180 --> 22:49.930
Hiiragi Renji, protect Elis even if it costs you your life.

22:51.830 --> 22:53.470
You don't have to say it.

22:56.780 --> 22:58.310
Kirihito-kun!

22:58.310 --> 22:59.890
Make haste, Elis.

22:59.890 --> 23:00.920
Let's go.

24:51.020 --> 24:54.510
Avoiding pursuit, Elis heads to the city from her past.

24:54.510 --> 24:58.180
There, she bears witness to the truth.

24:58.180 --> 25:02.620
And what's more, Anzelotte chooses to send out Himuro Akari.

25:02.620 --> 25:06.270
She's serious. So what are you going to do, Hiiragi?

25:06.730 --> 25:11.650
Next, on Night Wizard THE ANIMATION: Pieces of Memories, Dance to Illusion.

25:12.280 --> 25:14.730
Do we really have to fight?
